#{[{:activity/expected-seconds 420.0 :activity/first-step {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129995} :activity/id #uuid "08d5ebdb-d36f-5ada-8dab-70cc77c19c31" :activity/scope {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050601 :topic/id #uuid "577aebce-a9af-5bcd-867f-fb32f559c852" :topic/math-academy-id 2049} :activity/steps [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129995 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186130363 :tutorial/content "It's possible to determine information regarding the multiplicities of the roots of a polynomial from its graph. We summarize all possible cases in the table below:\n\n| Multiplicity | Case 1 | Case 2 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $1$ \n\n (Simple root) \n\n Odd | ![](images/5a/5a0221f93c65a1eeb4503604a558a6da81c4c7af81c2c52cc35ecf3d189fe99f.png) | ![](images/d5/d556b4edf39181eebb7ec87c344d6f657a6875ecd2745405eaf5351ccaff6f96.png) |\n| $>1$ \n\n (Multiple root) \n\n Even | ![](images/9d/9d14c2588da2ee9c9f5bbc32a70791146bed609ea0d6d5912aeaa2edab02e2d7.png) | ![](images/28/28ad9248a9a509e3a44937d0438fb2366f550a22360d01b9b6a29bcac41357e8.png) |\n| $>1$ \n\n (Multiple root) \n\n Odd | ![](images/3a/3ae81378cb3c918dd5b7730519eb5a91e949f88eef9f03f4910f4ab8fb3cd5a9.png) | ![](images/95/9506a7ce4031f1f6244c0110c3235f66ea5652bb53548a032732869cf21f5997.png) |\n\nNote the following:\n\n- The graph is **tangent** to the $x$-axis at multiple roots. This means that if $x=a$ is a multiple root, then the graph of the polynomial is parallel to the $x$-axis at this point.\n\n- If the multiplicity of a root $x=a$ is *even*, the graph just touches the $x$-axis and reverses direction at $x=a.$\n\n- If the multiplicity of a root $x=a$ is *odd* (including a simple root of multiplicity $1$), the graph crosses the $x$-axis at $x=a.$\n\n- The graph of the polynomial is *never* tangent to the $x$-axis at simple roots." :tutorial/id #uuid "7d750148-b50a-541e-99a4-c4dcd72534bd" :tutorial/math-academy-id 3755 :tutorial/title "Introduction"} :step/id #uuid "45a09efc-6d6e-57a9-a797-d0c0b127bf27" :step/math-academy-id 21038 :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186130184}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129998 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129145 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186128960 :question/id #uuid "2f03be7e-0a77-5869-b591-6a8f8f3942de" :question/math-academy-id "e-5814"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "4fc09a0f-34d3-5ca9-9964-6cb00498bfa7" :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186517437} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129690} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129691} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186234015} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186234016} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186247292} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186247293} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186326714} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186348369} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186348370} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186348371} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186517386} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186517400} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186517413} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186517414} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186517423} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186517428} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186517432} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186517436} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186566201} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186573890}] :knowledge-point/title "Identifying the Factored Polynomial Shown in a Graph"} :step/id #uuid "4d3e2ed9-de76-5074-a0bb-abe21e14e37a" :step/math-academy-id 21042 :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186130000}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186130000 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129147 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186128963 :question/id #uuid "e158501f-0bac-5d16-956a-59da7f82620f" :question/math-academy-id "e-5818"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "d03ac24f-82a6-5af8-b1b8-9021e521d47a" :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186518473} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129681} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186129682} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186247294} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186326705} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186348372} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186348373} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186348374} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186518426} {:db/id #edb